    "causal_summary": "The Pi preflight decides with `inspectDispatch`, which returns `none` for `echo \"$(codex exec task)\"` (its expansion check wants a print flag Codex does not have) and for wrapped calls such as `nohup opencode run ...` or `command codex exec task`, so those dispatches skip authorization and every hard rule",
